    "chunk_text": "\u00d0eos wyrt \u00fee man betonican nemne\u00f0, heo bi\u00fe cenned on m\u00e6dum & on cl\u00e6num dunlandum & on Seo deah gehw\u00e6\u00feer ge \u00fe\u00e6s mannes sawle ge his lichoman. Hio hyne scylde\u00fe wi\u00f0 unhyrum nihtgengum & wi\u00f0 egeslicum gesih\u00f0um & swefnum. & seo wyrt by\u00fe swy\u00fee haligu. & \u00feus \u00feu hi scealt niman on Agustes mon\u00f0e butan iserne. & \u00feonne \u00feu hi genumene h\u00e6bbe, ahryse \u00fea moldan of, \u00fe\u00e6t hyre nanwiht on ne clyfie, & \u00feonne drig hi Bruc hyre \u00feonne & hyre byrig \u00feonne \u00f0u be\u00feurfe. Gif mannes heafod tobrocen sy genim \u00fea ylcan wyrte betonican, scearfa hy \u00feonne & gnid swy\u00fee smale Genim \u00feonne twega trymessa w\u00e6ge, \u00feige hit \u00feonne on hatum beore. \u00deonne hala\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heafod swy\u00f0e hra\u00f0e \u00e6fter \u00feam drince. Wi\u00f0 eagena sar genim \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan wyrte wyrttruman, seo\u00f0 on w\u00e6tere to \u00feriddan d\u00e6le; & of \u00feam & genim \u00fe\u00e6r\u00e6 sylfan wyrte leaf & bryt hy & lege ofer \u00fea eagan on \u00feone andwlatan. Wi\u00f0 earena sar genim \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan wyrte leaf \u00feonne heo grenost beo. Wyl on w\u00e6tere & wring \u00fe\u00e6t wos & si\u00fe\u00fean hyt gestanden beo do hit eft wearm & \u00feurh wulle drype on Wi\u00f0 egena dymnesse genim \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan wyrte betonican anre tremesse w\u00e6ge & wyl on w\u00e6tere & syle \u00deonne gewana\u00f0 hit \u00feone d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s",
